    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... the \"story\" i was telling everyone was the only thing that mattered. now it's just ruined. if i stay, i'm just going to keep failing and watching everyone's faces change when they realize i'm not actually special. i'd rather they remember me as the person who actually succeeded than the person who just slowly fell apart and became a burden. it feels like everything is already broken.",
