      "content": "i don't know if \"rebuilding\" is even possible. i feel like the person they loved was a version of me that doesn't exist anymore. staying around just feels like I'm forcing them to watch my decline. wouldn't it be more merciful to just let them keep the memory of who I used to be? instead of letting them see the messy, broken version that's left?",
